  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/4dzJ9yxX/Advanced-Netherite-Banner-V13.png\" alt=\"旗帜\"></p>\n<h1><strong>高级下界合金 (Forge / NeoForge)</strong></h1>\n<p>这是 <strong>Forge / NeoForge</strong> 版本，如需 Fabric 版本请点击 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>！</p>\n<h5><strong>NeoForge：</strong>Minecraft 1.20.4 及以上版本</h5>\n<h5><strong>Forge：</strong>Minecraft 1.16.x - 1.21.5</h5>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></p>\n<h3><strong>📖 简介</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>高级下界合金</strong> 是一款可配置、兼容原版且开源的模组，它增加了更多层级的下界合金！\n该模组旨在通过增加更多目标来丰富原版 Minecraft 的体验。</p>\n<p>如需更多信息，请访问 <a href=\"https://github.com/Autovw/AdvancedNetherite/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">高级下界合金 Wiki</a>！</p>\n<p>感谢 <a href=\"https://twitter.com/LizterZapZap\" rel=\"nofollow\">LizterZapZap</a> 制作全新且优化的材质！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></p>\n<h3><strong>✅ 特性</strong></h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Autovw/AdvancedNetherite/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/MTd6yX4W/Advanced-Netherite-Features-V11.png\" alt=\"特性\"></a></p>\n<ul>\n<li>4 个<strong>全新</strong>的下界合金层级！</li>\n<li>每个新的下界合金层级都包含工具套装、护甲套装和方块</li>\n<li>每个下界合金层级都有独特的属性（特殊护甲加成、工具额外掉落）</li>\n<li>支持插件（Add-ons）与数据包（Datapacks）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></p>\n<h3><strong>💎 下界合金层级</strong></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/MT1VXszQ/Types-Of-Netherite-Banner-V2.png\" alt=\"层级\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></p>\n<h3><strong>🔨 合成配方</strong></h3>\n<p>模组的合成配方可以在 <a href=\"https://github.com/Autovw/AdvancedNetherite/wiki/Crafting-Recipes\" rel=\"nofollow\">高级下界合金 Wiki</a> 上查看，或者直接安装 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Items (JEI)</a> 即可！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></p>\n<h3><strong>🔖 热门版本链接</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=26.1.2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 26.1.2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.21.11\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.21.11</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.21.8\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.21.8</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.21.5\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.21.5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.21.4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.21.4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.21.1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.21.1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.20.6\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.20.6</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.20.4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.20.4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.20.1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.20.1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.19.4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.19.4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.19.3\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.19.3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.19.2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.19.2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.18.2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.18.2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.18.1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.18.1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.17.1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.17.1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.16.5\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.16.5</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></p>\n<h3><strong>ℹ 更多信息</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>请将问题反馈至 <a href=\"https://github.com/Autovw/AdvancedNetherite/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 上的问题追踪器</a>！</li>\n<li>可以将你的模组收录到我的 CurseForge 整合包中吗？当然可以！</li>\n<li>高级下界合金也提供 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a> 版本。</li>\n<li>点击 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/screenshots\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a> 查看更多截图！</li>\n<li>访问 <a href=\"https://github.com/Autovw/AdvancedNetherite/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">高级下界合金 Wiki</a> 了解更多关于本模组新增内容的信息。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></p>\n<h3><strong>💬 加入我的 Discord 服务器！</strong></h3>\n<p><em>如果你希望在新版本更新、模组支持及其他动态发布时收到通知，请 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/KP3BBatuw5\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入我的 Discord 服务器</a>！</em></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></p>\n<h4><strong>⚠️ 免责声明</strong></h4>\n<p>本模组仅通过 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fadvanced-netherite\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> 以及 <a href=\"https://github.com/Autovw/AdvancedNetherite/releases\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方 GitHub 仓库</a> 进行分发。\n请勿重新分发本模组 <em>或</em> 从任何其他下载源获取本模组。</p>\n<p>有关模组搬运的详细信息以及如何防范，请访问： <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fstopmodreposts.org%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">stopmodreposts.org</a>。</p>",
